    "note": "bincode feature dropped (its 2.x derive graph does not reconstruct under rustc 1.97); the driver reads the in-memory game and needs no serialization. The dangerous_implicit_autorefs lint became deny-by-default after the solver's 2023 commit and is allowed via RUSTFLAGS without editing locked source. RAYON_NUM_THREADS=1 pins the solve to a single worker so it is byte-reproducible across machines regardless of core count."
